// Per-zone hitboxes in player-local space (Bevy axes: +Y up, -Z = the way the player faces, feet at the origin).
// The boxes are mirror-symmetric, so handedness does not matter here.
// Front-view sizes come from the range training dummy (design/maps/range/diagrams/layout_data.py, DUMMY_ZONES);
// depths are placeholders until the character meshes are rigged.
// Boxes are given standing; crouch and slide scale every y by the stance height ratio (capsule heights).
